<title>JAPAN: Avon Products plans share buy-back.</title>
<headline>Avon Products plans share buy-back.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Avon Products Co Ltd said in a statement on Wednesday that it plans to buy back two million of its own shares worth 550 million yen.</p>
<p>The company did not elaborate on the plan.</p>
<p>It had issued 62.29 million shares as of November 30, 1996.</p>
<p>At 0714 GMT, Avon&quot;s shares were at 230 yen on the over-the-counter market, compared with Tuesday&quot;s close of 244 yen.</p>
<p>The company is 65.6 percent owned by Avon International Operations Inc, a unit of Avon Products Inc.</p>
